she won't be any good.

46
00:03:35,883 --> 00:03:38,753
-That's great news.
-It is?

47
00:03:38,786 --> 00:03:41,789
Sure, because when you're
afraid of something,

48
00:03:41,823 --> 00:03:44,926
that means it's your chance
to be brave!

49
00:03:46,894 --> 00:03:50,565
♪ You gotta be scared
to be brave ♪

50
00:03:50,598 --> 00:03:53,801
♪ You can't face your fears
unless at first you're afraid ♪

51
00:03:53,835 --> 00:03:56,838
♪ When you want to run away
and just hide in a cave ♪

52
00:03:56,871 --> 00:04:00,340
♪ Just remember you gotta
be scared to be brave ♪

53
00:04:01,943 --> 00:04:05,345
♪ It can be scary
to try something new ♪

54
