Way to go, Freddy!

59
00:04:21,963 --> 00:04:24,899
I guess it wasn't as scary
as I thought.

60
00:04:24,932 --> 00:04:26,333
Oh.

61
00:04:26,366 --> 00:04:27,535
Oh!

62
00:04:33,841 --> 00:04:35,543
Hey, what moves
are you going to do

63
00:04:35,576 --> 00:04:37,812
