64
00:04:37,845 --> 00:04:39,947
I don't like dancing.

65
00:04:39,981 --> 00:04:41,549
I'm gonna go read my book.

66
00:04:41,582 --> 00:04:43,483
Hmm. Okay, Josh.

67
00:04:45,052 --> 00:04:47,989
Looks like someone else
needs to learn to be brave.

68
00:04:49,624 --> 00:04:50,992
Oh, hey!

69
00:04:51,025 --> 00:04:54,394
I saw Oliver and Betty
at the clubhouse.

70
00:04:54,427 --> 00:04:55,797
Can you show them the dance

71
00:04:55,830 --> 00:04:58,566
so we'll all be ready
for the party?

72
00:04:58,599 --> 00:04:59,967
I'll talk to Josh.

73
00:05:02,069 --> 00:05:03,171
Hey, guys!

74
00:05:03,204 --> 00:05:05,673
Are you excited for Buddy's
big dance party tonight?

75
00:05:05,706 --> 00:05:07,374
You bet!

76
00:05:07,407 --> 00:05:09,977
Everybunny loves to dance.

77
00:05:13,147 --> 00:05:15,482
Wow, that was so cool.

78
00:05:15,516 --> 00:05:18,886
There are dances
from all over the world.

79
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:20,788
This dance is called ballet.

80
00:05:20,822 --> 00:05:23,825
Ballet dancers have to be
strong and flexible.

81
00:05:23,858 --> 00:05:25,927
Tap dancing is
all about the rhythm you make

82
00:05:25,960 --> 00:05:26,861
with your feet.

83
00:05:26,894 --> 00:05:29,063
Special shoes with taps
on the heel and toe

84
00:05:29,096 --> 00:05:31,431
make all sorts of fun sounds.

85
00:05:31,464 --> 00:05:33,134
Ballroom dancing
is when two people

86
00:05:33,167 --> 00:05:34,502
are dancing with each other.

87
00:05:34,535 --> 00:05:37,038
It's all about working together.

88
00:05:40,608 --> 00:05:41,843
Hey, Josh.

89
00:05:41,876 --> 00:05:43,144
Why don't you tell
your problems

90
00:05:43,177 --> 00:05:45,580
to the Worry Well?

91
00:05:45,613 --> 00:05:47,414
Did someone say my name?

92
00:05:47,447 --> 00:05:49,650
Did I do something wrong?

93
00:05:49,684 --> 00:05:51,519
Don't worry, Worry Well.

94
00:05:51,552 --> 00:05:52,954
We have a dance party tonight,

95
00:05:52,987 --> 00:05:55,756
but Josh is afraid
he won't dance well.

96
00:05:55,790 --> 00:05:58,593
I'm not afraid,
I just don't want to do it.

97
00:05:58,626 --> 00:06:01,062
It's my job
to help with worries.

98
00:06:01,095 --> 00:06:03,496
Let me see what I have here.

99
00:06:03,531 --> 00:06:04,966
Hmm.

100
00:06:04,999 --> 00:06:08,102
Oh, look.

101
00:06:08,135 --> 00:06:09,570
Oh, wow!

102
00:06:09,604 --> 00:06:11,706
Why didn't I think of that?

103
00:06:11,739 --> 00:06:14,441
Magic dancing shoes.

104
00:06:14,474 --> 00:06:16,476
With magic dancing shoes, Josh,

105
00:06:16,510 --> 00:06:19,146
you're sure to have
all the best moves!

106
00:06:19,180 --> 00:06:20,147
