one little dance move.

121
00:07:17,638 --> 00:07:19,573
I never made a deal.

122
00:07:19,607 --> 00:07:22,442
I just don't want to dance!

123
00:07:26,981 --> 00:07:28,816
Stick your leg out, Josh,

124
00:07:28,849 --> 00:07:30,518
just stick your leg out
one time.

125
00:07:30,551 --> 00:07:31,752
Let go of me!

126
00:07:31,786 --> 00:07:33,754
Just stick your leg out
one time.

127
00:07:33,788 --> 00:07:34,889
You're hurting me!

128
00:07:34,922 --> 00:07:36,657
Leave me alone! I hate you!

129
00:07:36,691 --> 00:07:38,159
No! You don't mean it!

130
00:07:38,192 --> 00:07:40,728
Yes, I do. Now let go of me
or I'll scream!

131
00:07:40,761 --> 00:07:42,163
Oh, no, you won't.

132
00:07:42,196 --> 00:07:43,197
No, you wo--

