Hey, Nurse Nancy.

134
00:07:48,636 --> 00:07:50,638
Are you having a good time?

135
00:07:50,671 --> 00:07:52,606
No, Buddy...

136
00:07:52,640 --> 00:07:54,141
I'm having a great time.

137
00:07:55,876 --> 00:07:56,978
Hey, Buddy!

138
00:07:57,011 --> 00:07:58,713
Come on.

139
00:07:58,746 --> 00:08:00,147
We made up a dance for you.

140
00:08:00,181 --> 00:08:01,515
Because we love you.

141
00:08:01,549 --> 00:08:02,717
Aww.

142
00:08:02,750 --> 00:08:04,151
I love you, too.

143
00:08:04,185 --> 00:08:05,653
But where's Josh?

144
00:08:05,686 --> 00:08:08,089
That's what I wanted
to tell you.

145
00:08:08,122 --> 00:08:10,091
After I taught Josh
to dance,

146
00:08:10,124 --> 00:08:11,826
