1054
00:58:52,933 --> 00:58:55,002
Exiles, I suppose.

1055
00:58:55,036 --> 00:58:57,238
Mm!

1056
00:58:57,271 --> 00:58:59,040
Ow!

1057
00:59:00,641 --> 00:59:02,977
Ah.

1058
00:59:03,010 --> 00:59:05,079
Mm!

1059
00:59:05,112 --> 00:59:06,313
Mm.

